      "tag_source": "source_en",
      "source_jp": "【参謀日課】盗賊アジト　情報収集",
      "source_en": "[Daily Council] Bandit Hideout - Collect Information",
      "text": "[Strategie täglich] Versteck der Diebe – Informationen sammeln"
    },
    {
      "key": "q60300062_00_281",
      "read_index": "1",
      "tag_source": "source_en",
      "source_jp": "依頼者から復興に関する\r\n問題解決に挑む",
      "source_en": "Tackle the issue related to reconstruction,\r\nas presented by the requester",
      "text": "Hilf dem Auftraggeber\r\nbei seiner Aufgabe zum Wiederaufbau."
    },
    {
      "key": "q60300062_00_3552",
      "read_index": "2",
      "tag_source": "source_en",
      "source_jp": "<STG 1001> で<NPC 582>と待ち合わせる",
      "source_en": "Meet at <STG 1001> with <NPC 582>",
      "text": "Geh zu „<STG 1001>“ und triff dich mit <NPC 582>."
    },
    {
      "key": "q60300062_00_3553",
      "read_index": "3",
      "tag_source": "source_en",
      "source_jp": "行方不明になった盗賊仲間を探しに向かう",
      "source_en": "Head out to search for the missing thief",
      "text": "Suche nach dem vermissten Dieb."
    },
    {
      "key": "q60300062_00_3554",
      "read_index": "4",
      "tag_source": "source_en",
      "source_jp": "敵を討伐する",
      "source_en": "Defeat the enemy",
      "text": "Besiege den Gegner."
    },
    {
      "key": "q60300062_00_3555",
      "read_index": "5",
      "tag_source": "source_en",
      "source_jp": "<NPC 600>の様子を確認する",
      "source_en": "Confirm the condition of <NPC 600>",
      "text": "Sieh nach, wie es <NPC 600> geht."
    },
    {
      "key": "q60300062_00_3556",
      "read_index": "6",
      "tag_source": "source_en",
      "source_jp": "新たに襲撃にきた敵を討伐する",
      "source_en": "Defeat the newly attacking enemy",
      "text": "Besiege die herbeigeeilte Verstärkung."
    },
    {
      "key": "q60300062_00_3557",
      "read_index": "7",
      "tag_source": "source_en",
      "source_jp": "<STG 1001> に戻り<NPC 582>に報告する",
      "source_en": "Return to <STG 1001> and report to <NPC 582>",
      "text": "Kehre zu „<STG 1001>“ zurück und erstatte <NPC 582> Bericht."
